# Isolated install for SkillSpector. Kept separate from requirements-scanners.in
# because SkillSpector needs Python 3.12/3.13 for prebuilt yara-python wheels
# (Muninn's main image is Python 3.14) and brings a LangChain/YARA stack that
# would conflict with semgrep/checkov. The Docker image installs this into its
# own Python 3.13 venv.
# Compile: make skillspector-lock
skillspector==2.13.7
